><text for="L10">Brain rot 还要更多 尽情嗨到灰飞烟灭</text><text for="L11">Brain rot 已然无法停歇</text><text for="L12">Brain rot 糖分岂能相提并论</text><text for="L13">Brain rot 还要更多 尽情嗨到灰飞烟灭</text><text for="L14">彻底疯狂 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(天哪！糟糕的早晨)</span></text><text for="L15">纵使察觉 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(天哪！糟糕的早晨)</span></text><text for="L16">也无法挣脱 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(天哪！糟糕的早晨)</span></text><text for="L17">不 还是太迟了</text><text for="L18">Brain rot 已然无法停歇</text><text for="L19">Brain rot 糖分岂能相提并论</text><text for="L20">Brain rot 还要更多 尽情嗨到灰飞烟灭</text><text for="L21">Brain rot 已然无法停歇</text><text for="L22">Brain rot 糖分岂能相提并论</text><text for="L23">Brain rot 还要更多 尽情嗨到灰飞烟灭</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="01:57.982"><div begin="00:07.443" end="01:57.982"><p begin="00:07.443" end="00:10.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:07.443" end="00:07.835">用法</span><span begin="00:07.835" end="00:08.234">容量</span><span begin="00:08.234" end="00:08.983">度外視</span><span begin="00:08.983" end="00:09.403">合法 </span><span begin="00:09.403" end="00:09.854">doping </span><span begin="00:09.854" end="00:10.195">time</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="00:10.353" end="00:10.624">(Time)</span></span></p><p begin="00:10.971" end="00:14.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:10.971" end="00:11.401">死体</span><span begin="00:11.401" end="00:12.102">のようで</span><span begin="00:12.102" end="00:12.542">脳は </span><span begin="00:12.542" end="00:13.001">Happy </span><span begin="00:13.001" end="00:13.469">Happy </span><span begin="00:13.469" end="00:13.891">Happy </span><span begin="00:13.891" end="00:14.321">Dance</span></p><p begin="00:14.545" end="00:18.665" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:14.545" end="00:14.915">「ちょっと</span><span begin="00:14.915" end="00:15.305">だけ</span><span begin="00:15.305" end="00:16.065">休憩」で</span><span